OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity students 'brave the
OL,4,Ashave' to raise #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity students have raised #1m in
OL,7,Fsupport of the Movember men's health
OL,8,Fcampaign.
OL,10,FOver the last decade, students at the
OL,11,FUniversity of Exeter has supported the
OL,12,Fannual month-long campaign which raises
OL,13,Fawareness about issues facing men,
OL,14,Fincluding mental health and prostate
OL,15,Fcancer, through fundraisers and events.
OL,17,FIt reached the milestone at its Brave
OL,18,Fthe Shave event, where students not
OL,19,Fjust shaved their beards but also their
OL,20,Fheads, organisers said.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
