OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity students 'brave the
OL,4,Ashave' to raise #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeia West, the University of Exeter's
OL,7,Fambassador for Movember, said "reaching
OL,8,Fthe milestone was incredible", as it
OL,9,Fwas a such a personal cause to herself
OL,10,Fand many other students.
